5,1,1,talk,Servas,,Hello everyone. It is a pleasure to see you all. Let us find a way to divide our bills that keeps our hearts light and our home warm.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree. I have noticed we have been a bit tense lately when talking about money. I want us to find a system that prevents any hard feelings.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I also want us to be happy. I sometimes hear people saying some are paying more than others... is that true? I want to know the truth.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"Let's be real, the current system is a mess. I'm tired of my bank account taking a hit every winter. We need a plan that actually makes sense.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I agree. I just... I hope we can find something that isn't too complicated to manage every month.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, your frustration is heard. However, let us remember that a home is more than a ledger. We should look at how others manage this balance.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, I understand. If the system is too hard, it just leads to more mistakes and more arguments. We need something simple but fair.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"Maybe we can look at the numbers? If we see how much we actually use, we won't have to guess or worry about rumors.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"Exactly, Minato. I'm not signing off on anything until I see the actual yearly trend. I don't want any more ""surprise"" bills in January.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think looking at how other houses do it might help. I don't want anyone to feel burdened by the work.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,A wise suggestion. I believe we should investigate the historical usage and perhaps a template to see if we can simplify the process for everyone.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I think it is important to see the payment log. I want to understand where the friction has been so we can avoid it in the future.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I want to see the plug-in monitors. I'm curious if some rooms use way more electricity than others. That would be fair to check, right?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"Fair, but not enough. I want to know if changing the setup requires an investment. If we need new wiring, who pays for that?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look into the templates... and maybe the payment log. I want to see how much time the current way takes.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us proceed with these investigations. I shall look into the monthly settle of another house and the reconciliation template.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I will look at the payment log and the last twelve utility statements. I want to see the patterns of our payments.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I will check the plug-in monitor readings and the sunlight and heating needs of each room. I want to see the real data.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I'm going for the electrician's quote and the last twelve utility statements. I need to know the cost of change and the yearly peaks.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll check the trial run of a reconciliation template and the payment log for the last twelve months.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
