35,2,1,talk,Servas,,I have seen that precision often comes with a price of time and effort. We must ask if a few coins are worth the loss of our peace.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I saw the payment log. It is sad, but we have had several late payments and arguments. The money is definitely affecting our friendship.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,I found out that some rooms use four times more electricity than others! Some rooms are also much colder because of the sun. It's not equal.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The winter bills are a nightmare—nearly 30,000 yen in February! And if we want separate meters, it's 34,000 yen per room. That's a huge upfront cost.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I saw the template. It looks like it takes hours to fill out. And the payment log shows people are getting frustrated because it takes so long.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, the disparity in usage is natural. But if we punish the cold room, we create a house of shivering people. That is not a home.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, 34,000 yen per room is too much. I don't think we should spend that much money just to avoid talking to each other.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"But if someone uses a heater all day and someone else doesn't, isn't it unfair for the other person to pay for it? I just want it to be right.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"It's not just about fairness, Minato, it's about predictability. I can't handle a bill that jumps from 9,000 to 30,000. We need a way to smooth that out.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,If we choose a system that is too precise... I'm worried the person doing the math will spend their whole weekend on it.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,Perhaps a middle path exists. One that acknowledges the difference in usage but maintains a spirit of generosity and simplicity.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree. I would rather we pay a little more than is ""perfectly fair"" if it means we stop avoiding each other for a week after a reminder.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"I understand... I don't want people to be angry. But if we just ignore the four-times difference, will the person paying more still be upset?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"If we can't afford the meters, we can't have perfect precision. We need a system that averages the cost over the year so the winter doesn't kill us.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, if we average it, does that mean the person managing it only has to do the math once a year? That would be much better.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us consider the options. We must decide if we value the exactness of the coin or the warmth of the atmosphere.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,I will vote for whatever minimizes the need for constant reminders and disputes. Harmony is more valuable than a few hundred yen.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I will think about it. I want to be fair, but I also want everyone to be smiling. I'll look for the option that balances both.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,I'm voting for stability. No more huge spikes in February and no massive upfront installation fees. Let's keep it simple and predictable.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I just... I really hope we don't pick something that requires a lot of manual data entry every single month.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
