60,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option B offers a gentle rhythm. It removes the monthly anxiety and allows us to live without counting every single watt of energy.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I strongly prefer Option B. It stops the monthly ""who owes what"" tension and the late payment arguments I saw in the logs.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,"Option A is the most fair because of the monitor readings, but May said it is very expensive. I don't want to make people sad about money.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,Option A is out—too expensive. Option C is just the same nightmare we have now with the winter spikes. Option B is the only one that saves my budget.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,Option B... that means the math only happens once a year. That's much less work for whoever has to do it. I like that.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, remember that fairness is not always about numbers. True fairness is when everyone feels they can breathe and relax in their own home.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Minato, if we go with B, we can just help each other out at the end of the year. It's much kinder than a monthly bill that changes wildly.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"I think I understand. If we use Option B, we don't have to fight every month. Even if it's not perfectly precise, it's more peaceful.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,Exactly. I can set aside a fixed amount every month and not worry about February. It's the only way I can actually plan my life.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm worried about the year-end settle for Option B, but it's still better than doing it twelve times. It's... manageable.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Servas,,It seems we have found a path that respects both the wallet and the spirit. Let us choose the way that fosters generosity.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Midori,,I feel much better now. I think this will stop the cycle of reminders and avoidance. I'm happy we talked this through.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,"I'll vote for B. I was worried about the usage difference, but I'd rather we be friends than be perfectly accurate.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,I'm all for B. It solves the predictability problem and avoids the electrician's bill. It's the most logical choice for all of us.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll vote for B too. It's the least stressful for the person in charge of the bills. I... I think it's the best way.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Servas,,A consensus of hearts. Let us cast our votes and return to the joy of sharing our home.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let's move forward with a system that puts our friendship first.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Minato,,I'm glad we all agree. I feel much more relaxed now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,May,,Finally. Let's just get this decided so I can stop stressing about my winter budget.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,Yes... let's do it.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
